      "type": "numbered_list",
      "items": [
        "1–3 breakpoints",
        "Not dozens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If you need many breakpoints, your layout is probably too rigid."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Before writing responsive CSS, developers make one mindset shift:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Design for small screens first."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "items": [
        "Mobile screens are the most constrained.",
        "It forces clarity.",
        "Desktop layouts are easier to scale up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In modern frontend work, mobile is not an afterthought — it's the baseline."
